Character sets are decoded by go-fast-core's charset package, messages
and MIME read by its rfc822 package and compound files (.msg) by its cfb
package; this library's internal/charset, internal/rfc822 and
internal/cfb were merged into them. Their tables and the sources of the
tables (the Unicode Consortium's mapping files and Unihan database,
Python's codecs, the WHATWG Encoding Standard) are listed in go-fast-core's
NOTICE.

